@startuml Saga_Success
title Saga-хореография: успешное оформление заказа

actor "Покупатель" as Customer
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Delivery Service" as Delivery
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
participant "Seller Service" as Seller

Customer -> Order: Подтвердить заказ
activate Order
Order -> Order: Создать заказ (статус PENDING)
Order -> Bus: **OrderCreated**
deactivate Order

Bus -> Inventory: OrderCreated
activate Inventory
Inventory -> Inventory: Проверить и зарезервировать товары
alt Товары доступны
    Inventory -> Bus: **InventoryReserved**
    deactivate Inventory

    Bus -> Payment: InventoryReserved
    activate Payment
    Payment -> Payment: Списать средства
    alt Оплата успешна
        Payment -> Bus: **PaymentSucceeded**
        deactivate Payment

        Bus -> Order: PaymentSucceeded
        activate Order
        Order -> Order: Статус → CONFIRMED
        Order -> Bus: **OrderConfirmed**
        deactivate Order

        Bus -> Delivery: OrderConfirmed
        activate Delivery
        Delivery -> Delivery: Создать заявку в логистике
        Delivery -> Bus: **DeliveryScheduled**
        deactivate Delivery

        Bus -> Notify: OrderConfirmed / DeliveryScheduled
        activate Notify
        Notify -> Customer: Push: «Заказ подтверждён, передан в доставку»
        deactivate Notify

        Bus -> Seller: OrderConfirmed
        activate Seller
        Seller -> Seller: Уведомить продавца о новом заказе
        deactivate Seller
    else Оплата отклонена
        Payment -> Bus: **PaymentFailed**
        deactivate Payment
        note right: Переход к компенсации (см. диаграмму ошибок)
    end
else Товара нет в наличии
    Inventory -> Bus: **InventoryReserveFailed**
    deactivate Inventory
    note right: Переход к компенсации (см. диаграмму ошибок)
end
@enduml
